      "name": "Original Fourier component fixtures \u2014 MIT",
      "description": "Original part illustration, color impulses, reference images, generator and projects under this repository's MIT license. The RGB impulses have independent pixel-assignment references. Phase-only must produce unit impulses at their original positions; magnitude-only retains their amplitudes at [0,0]. Arithmetic converts reference integer counts to float64 units. Every comparison must stay below 1e-12. OpenCV DFT reference: https://docs.opencv.org/5.0/main_modules/core_array.html",
